xt{d}x}(ye^{4 x})\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 16 e^{4 x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ ye^{4 x} & =16\\left(\\frac{1}{4} e^{4 x}\\right)+C \\\\ ye^{4 x} & =4 e^{4 x}+C \\\\ y & =\\left(C + 4 e^{4 x}\\right) e^{- 4 x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the general solution. To find the value of $C$ corresponding to the specific solution, we apply the initial condition $y(0)=-1$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =\\frac{(4 e^{4 (0)})+C}{(e^{4 (0)})} \\\\ -1 & =\\frac{4+C}{1} \\\\ C & =-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=4 - 5 e^{- 4 x}.\n$$" 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671132 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671139 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671132 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671144 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671132 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671162 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671132 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671166 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671132 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671171 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671132 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671132 1077 "field-2" 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671132 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671144 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671132 1079 #uuid "394794f2-0640-5017-a3b6-371d2f2b6119" 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671133 1080 "e^{4 x}" 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671133 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671133 1083 #uuid "458dee71-46fb-5f60-bbfe-dd95564739be" 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671134 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671125 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671134 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671130 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671134 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671143 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671134 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671161 13194139538657 17592186045443 true] [17592186671134 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671165 13194139538657 17592186045